{"logId": "ee6740c0-557f-4091-b11f-26b332983c29", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [364, 121, 788, 164], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[364.0, 121.0], [788.0, 121.0], [788.0, 164.0], [364.0, 164.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：保持积极、乐观的心态，有良好的自我调节能力，能够掌控自我情绪，也能够主动地调节身体指标保持相对健康的状态。", "block_bbox": [362, 231, 1592, 309], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[362.0, 231.0], [1592.0, 231.0], [1592.0, 309.0], [362.0, 309.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：精神和心理的健康会影响生命的质量和身体机能的平衡，长期的压力、生气、抑郁等会导致身体的郁结或不畅，最终损害健康。拥有积极、乐观、阳光的心态，遇到纠结或不开心的事情，就能很快调整并接受，保持内心的轻松、愉悦，关注自己精神和身体的变化，及时调整，良好的健康状态才能自然地达成。", "block_bbox": [362, 342, 1608, 468], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[362.0, 342.0], [1608.0, 342.0], [1608.0, 468.0], [362.0, 468.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [365, 512, 535, 544], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[365.0, 512.0], [535.0, 512.0], [535.0, 544.0], [365.0, 544.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、保持积极、乐观的心态，有生气、纠结、焦虑、抑郁等负面情绪，能很快地接受并进行正向调整", "block_bbox": [387, 570, 1542, 603], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[387.0, 570.0], [1542.0, 570.0], [1542.0, 603.0], [387.0, 603.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、经常给他人带来正能量", "block_bbox": [389, 614, 702, 645], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 614.0], [702.0, 614.0], [702.0, 645.0], [389.0, 645.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、与人争吵或产生矛盾，能够及时恢复理性，主动地沟通和化解（不超过1天）", "block_bbox": [388, 657, 1304, 689], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 657.0], [1304.0, 657.0], [1304.0, 689.0], [388.0, 689.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、有意识地调整或管控自我性格中不成熟的特征（如性格急躁、易嫉妒、贪婪等）", "block_bbox": [389, 701, 1342, 732], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 701.0], [1342.0, 701.0], [1342.0, 732.0], [389.0, 732.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、不钻牛角尖、不极端，能够全面综合地思考问题", "block_bbox": [389, 744, 992, 775], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 744.0], [992.0, 744.0], [992.0, 775.0], [389.0, 775.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、合理调节身体机能、健康指标等（注意暴饮暴食、酗酒、吸烟无度、长期熬夜等）", "block_bbox": [388, 787, 1368, 819], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 787.0], [1368.0, 787.0], [1368.0, 819.0], [388.0, 819.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、有安稳良好的睡眠", "block_bbox": [391, 831, 652, 862], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[391.0, 831.0], [652.0, 831.0], [652.0, 862.0], [391.0, 862.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、关注自己精神和身体状况，意识到自我抑郁、身体不适等，主动寻求帮助或及时就诊", "block_bbox": [388, 874, 1410, 906], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 874.0], [1410.0, 874.0], [1410.0, 906.0], [388.0, 906.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[99]", "block_bbox": [969, 971, 1017, 995], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[969.0, 971.0], [1016.0, 971.0], [1016.0, 994.0], [969.0, 994.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_i